  <NOTES 0 0
  |ICST HOA Reaper Template Pack #1
  |
  |Purpose
  |- Fast project bootstrap for HOA sessions in REAPER.
  |- Safe default: all HOA-relevant tracks are already set to 64 channels.
  |
  |Recommended next steps
  |1. Open Project Settings and confirm sample rate and audio device.
  |2. Insert ICST MonoEncoder or MultiEncoder on the source tracks as needed.
  |3. Route encoded output into the HOA BUS.
  |4. Insert your decoder on DECODER MAIN and load the preset for your loudspeaker layout.
  |5. Use BINAURAL CHECK for headphone verification if needed.
  |
  |Suggested signal flow
  |Sources -> HOA BUS -> DECODER MAIN
  |Sources -> HOA BUS -> BINAURAL CHECK
  |
  |Verification
  |- Check that Master is 64 channels.
  |- Check that HOA BUS, DECODER MAIN and all source tracks are 64 channels.
  |- Run a short signal test before recording.
  >
